msgid ""
"This is an open source LUA script to display :ref:`FrSky passthrough "
"telemetry <common-frsky-passthrough>` on Horus X10,X12, Jumper T16,T18, "
"Radiomaster TX16S, Taranis X9D,X9E,QX7 and Jumper T12 radios using OpenTX "
"2.2.3."
msgstr ""
"这是一个开源 LUA 脚本，使用 OpenTX 2.2.3 在 Horus X10、X12、Jumper T16、T18、Radiomaster "
"TX16S、Taranis X9D、X9E、QX7 和 Jumper T12 遥控器上显示 :ref:`FrSky 直通数传 <common-"
"frsky-passthrough>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:9 977eeb97dedd403e845ce4479e0c73ef
msgid ""
"This script can be used with FRSky, CRSF, or CRSF using the Passthru  option"
" (:ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 8 enbled when using CRSF)."
msgstr ""
"该脚本可与 FRSky、CRSF 配合使用，或使用直通选项的 CRSF（使用 CRSF 时启用 "
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 第 8 位）。"

