#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:36
#: 1da6f79ee24b4bad99a2e2c632867b9e 4d0f6a78a799482292f1c1db9fe637c8
#: 7dde470cd3b34131b1f3a4ce0c7ccf6f 7e2dce2aa84c42f196f1e3c234fd634a
#: ab369853d2764cf894e5ff9dd6bfb400 fe60b694478b4edc8987e967767d2562
msgid ""
"The script is also compatible with the excellent `MavlinkToPassthru "
"converter firmware <https://github.com/zs6buj/MavlinkToPassthru>`__ by Eric "
"Stockenstrom which allows alternative telemetry transport methods, such as "
"the data modem in DragonlinkRC RC systems, to feed MAVLink data into these "
"transmitters for display by this LUA script."
msgstr ""
"该脚本还与 Eric Stockenstrom 开发的优秀 `MavlinkToPassthru 转换器固件 "
"<https://github.com/zs6buj/MavlinkToPassthru>`__ 兼容，允许使用替代的数传传输方式（如 "
"DragonlinkRC 遥控系统中的数据调制解调器）将 MAVLink 数据馈送到这些遥控器，由该 LUA 脚本显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:38
#: 0a89ba16a63543bca39563c8f5977912 580b0d2cc4cb4999aa9f9a906b141853
