"Requires `OpenTX 2.2.x <http://www.open-tx.org/>`__ (2.2.3 recommended) and "
"a recent release of ArduPilot with support for :ref:`common-frsky-"
"passthrough`."
msgstr ""
"需要 `OpenTX 2.2.x <http://www.open-tx.org/>`__ （推荐 2.2.3）以及支持 :ref:`common-"
"frsky-passthrough` 的最新 ArduPilot 版本。"

